{"title": "Cheap LTO Tapes: How to Buy Used Tape Safely | TapeBackup.org", "html": "<div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-12\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6\">Cheap LTO Tapes: How to Buy Used Tape Safely</h1><p class=\"text-xl text-muted-foreground mb-10\">Buying <strong>cheap LTO tapes</strong> can dramatically reduce your archive storage costs \u2014 but only if you know what to look for. Many home labs and small businesses successfully use used LTO media to cut cost per TB. However, improper handling, poor storage, or worn-out cartridges can turn a bargain into data loss.</p><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-12\">This guide explains how to safely buy used tape, what to avoid, and when new media is worth the premium.</p><section class=\"mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">Why People Buy Cheap LTO Tapes</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">\ud83d\udcc9</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Lower cost per TB</span></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">\ud83d\udce6</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Expanding an existing tape library</span></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">\ud83e\uddea</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Testing or lab environments</span></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 p-4\"><span class=\"text-2xl\">\ud83d\uddc4</span><span class=\"font-medium\">Cold backup copies</span></div></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">Older generations like LTO-5 and LTO-6 are especially affordable on secondary markets, making them popular for long-term archival use.</p></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">New vs Used LTO Tapes: What's the Risk?</h2><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"p-0\"><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-auto\"><table class=\"w-full caption-bottom text-sm\"><thead class=\"[&amp;_tr]:border-b\"><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-bold\">Factor</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-bold\">New LTO Tape</th><th class=\"h-12 px-4 text-left align-middle text-muted-foreground [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-bold\">Used LTO Tape</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0\"><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">Cost</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Higher</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Much lower</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">Write Cycles</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">100% lifespan</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Unknown</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">Storage History</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Controlled</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Often unknown</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">Warranty</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Manufacturer</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Usually none</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b transition-colors data-[state=selected]:bg-muted hover:bg-muted/50\"><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 font-medium\">Reliability</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Maximum</td><td class=\"p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0\">Depends on prior use</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">When buying cheap LTO tapes, the <strong>unknown storage history</strong> is the biggest risk factor.</p></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">How to Buy Used Tape Safely</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5 p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 pb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-6 w-6 text-primary\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl\">1. Check the Generation Carefully</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Make sure the tape generation (LTO-5 through LTO-9) matches your drive. Drives are not universally compatible across all generations. Always confirm backward compatibility before purchasing.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5 p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 pb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package h-6 w-6 text-primary\"><path d=\"M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 7.703 4.734a2 2 0 0 0 1.994 0L20.7 7\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl\">2. Ask About Write Cycles</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Each LTO cartridge is rated for thousands of passes, but heavy enterprise use can reduce lifespan. Ask sellers: Was this used in a data center? Was it part of daily rotation? Is usage data available? If they cannot answer, assume moderate wear.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5 p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 pb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-6 w-6 text-destructive\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl\">3. Inspect Physical Condition</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Avoid buying if you see cracks in the plastic shell, warped casing, signs of mold or moisture, or heavy label residue covering vents. Environmental damage is one of the biggest risks when purchasing cheap LTO tapes.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5 p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 pb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-droplets h-6 w-6 text-primary\"><path d=\"M7 16.3c2.2 0 4-1.83 4-4.05 0-1.16-.57-2.26-1.71-3.19S7.29 6.75 7 5.3c-.29 1.45-1.14 2.84-2.29 3.76S3 11.1 3 12.25c0 2.22 1.8 4.05 4 4.05z\"></path><path d=\"M12.56 6.6A10.97 10.97 0 0 0 14 3.02c.5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5s3 3.5 3 5.5a6.98 6.98 0 0 1-11.91 4.97\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl\">4. Avoid Humidity-Exposed Media</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Tape is sensitive to improper storage. High humidity can cause mold growth, binder degradation, and read/write errors. If buying from unknown storage conditions (garage, attic, warehouse clearance), factor risk into pricing.</p></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"space-y-1.5 p-6 flex flex-row items-center gap-3 pb-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-test-tube h-6 w-6 text-primary\"><path d=\"M14.5 2v17.5c0 1.4-1.1 2.5-2.5 2.5c-1.4 0-2.5-1.1-2.5-2.5V2\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path><path d=\"M14.5 16h-5\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-xl\">5. Test Before Archiving Critical Data</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground\">Never immediately trust used tape for primary backups. Best practice: full format, write test data, verify checksum, run read-back test. Only after successful validation should it be used for archive storage.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">When Cheap LTO Tapes Make Sense</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-primary/30\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-5 w-5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg> Generally Safe When</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\"><li>\u2022 You need secondary copies</li><li>\u2022 You maintain multiple backup sets</li><li>\u2022 You rotate tapes frequently</li><li>\u2022 You are expanding a home lab</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm border-destructive/30\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-5 w-5 text-destructive\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg> Less Appropriate For</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\"><li>\u2022 Single-copy archival storage</li><li>\u2022 Regulatory retention requirements</li><li>\u2022 Mission-critical business backups</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">Best Practices for Long-Term Storage</h2><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm\"><div class=\"p-6 pt-6\"><p class=\"mb-4 text-muted-foreground\">Even new tape requires proper handling:</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check inline h-4 w-4 text-primary mr-2\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Store upright in cases</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check inline h-4 w-4 text-primary mr-2\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Maintain 40\u201360% humidity</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check inline h-4 w-4 text-primary mr-2\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Keep away from direct sunlight</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check inline h-4 w-4 text-primary mr-2\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Avoid magnetic interference</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check inline h-4 w-4 text-primary mr-2\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Label clearly with write date</li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">Final Verdict: Should You Buy Used LTO Media?</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-muted-foreground mb-4\">Buying <strong>cheap LTO tapes</strong> can be a smart cost-saving strategy \u2014 especially for non-critical archives or secondary backups.</p><div class=\"rounded-lg border text-card-foreground shadow-sm bg-muted/50\"><div class=\"p-6 pt-6 space-y-2 text-muted-foreground\"><p>\u2705 Always test before use</p><p>\u2705 Avoid visibly damaged cartridges</p><p>\u2705 Be cautious with unknown storage history</p><p>\u2705 Never rely on a single used tape for irreplaceable data</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-muted-foreground\">For critical archives, new media offers peace of mind. For labs and scale-focused storage, used tape can deliver outstanding value.</p></section><section class=\"mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"w-full\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"border-b\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-:r9:\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-:r8:\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 font-medium transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Are cheap LTO tapes reliable?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-:r9:\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-:r8:\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 36px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 896px;\" hidden=\"\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"border-b\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-:rb:\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-:ra:\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 font-medium transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">How long do used LTO tapes last?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-:rb:\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-:ra:\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 36px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 896px;\"><div class=\"pb-4 pt-0 text-muted-foreground\">Lifespan depends on prior use and storage conditions. Some may last years; others may fail early.</div></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"border-b\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-:rd:\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-:rc:\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 font-medium transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Is mold a real concern with tape media?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-:rd:\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-:rc:\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 36px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 896px;\"><div class=\"pb-4 pt-0 text-muted-foreground\">Yes. Poor humidity control can damage tape surfaces and cause read errors.</div></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"border-b\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-:rf:\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-:re:\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 font-medium transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Should I reformat used tape before use?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-:rf:\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-:re:\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 36px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 896px;\"><div class=\"pb-4 pt-0 text-muted-foreground\">Yes. Always perform a full format and validation cycle.</div></div></div><div data-state=\"open\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"border-b\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"open\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-:rh:\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-state=\"open\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-:rg:\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 font-medium transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Is it better to buy new or used LTO tapes?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"open\" id=\"radix-:rh:\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-:rg:\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"overflow-hidden text-sm transition-all data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height: var(--radix-collapsible-content-height); --radix-accordion-content-width: var(--radix-collapsible-content-width); --radix-collapsible-content-height: 36px; --radix-collapsible-content-width: 896px;\"><div class=\"pb-4 pt-0 text-muted-foreground\">New media offers maximum reliability. Used media is cost-effective but carries risk.</div></div></div></div></section></div></div>"}